        "body": "## What's Changed\n* Bump uuid from 8.3.2 to 14.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19799\n* Bump the all-non-major-security group across 1 directory with 5 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19810\n* Bump fast-copy from 3.0.2 to 3.1.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19811\n* Bump snowflake-sdk from 2.4.0 to 3.3.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19812\n* [#19793] Fix agent request boundaries within chat threads by @Tobertet in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19804\n* [BUDI-9339] Fix App Scripts for public users by @melohagan in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19822\n* Preserve escalation state when reloading chat preview by @adrinr in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19732\n* fix: unresolve packages by @Dakuan in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19819\n* Validate schema before submitting write tools by @adrinr in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19726\n* fix: handle large Redis scans by @calexiou in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19807\n* Merge Cloud changes back to master by @budibase-release-automation[bot] in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19827\n* Bump ip-address from 10.1.0 to 10.7.1 in the all-non-major-security group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19829\n* Require builder authorization for automation tests by @Dakuan in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19831\n* Merge Cloud changes back to master by @budibase-release-automation[bot] in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19841\n* Fix/session redis db and user sync backlog by @calexiou in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19826\n* Fix/publish off main loop by @calexiou in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19843\n* Fix/queue init on publish by @calexiou in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19853\n\n## New Contributors\n* @Tobertet made their first contribution in https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/pull/19804\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Budibase/budibase/compare/v3.49.0...v3.50.0",
